            "heading": "Bystronic Xpert 150/310",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Our Bystronic press brake delivers high-speed, high-precision forming for smaller and mid-sized sheet metal parts. </p><ul><li>150-ton hydraulic press</li><li>10-foot bed (3.05 m)</li><li>6-axis back-gauge for faster bend times</li><li>Bend angle accuracy within 0.5 degrees</li></ul><p>With superior repeatability and minimal setup time, it’s ideal for projects that need tight tolerances and consistent results. Perfect for stainless steel, aluminum, and mild steel applications.</p>",
