          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cincinnati Brake Press",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Our Cincinnati press brake provides the tonnage and bed length required for large-scale parts and structural components. Its dynamic crowning system ensures uniform press brake forming across long bends, eliminating errors and warping. </p><ul><li>350-ton capacity</li><li>16-foot bed (4.88 m)</li><li>Dynamic crowning for accurate angle control</li><li>Forms up to 1\" thick material</li></ul><p>Whether it's for construction, industrial, or OEM parts, this hydraulic press can shape even the toughest materials to your project specifications.</p>",
            "desktop_content_position": "center-md",
